    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "If complete drainage is impossible, a thrombolytic (eg, alteplase) plus a DNAse (eg, dornase alfa) can be given intrapleurally; if that fails, surgery (VATS first)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
