    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Pleurodesis: a sclerosing agent (talc, doxycycline or bleomycin) is instilled via chest tube or thoracoscopy; contraindicated if the lung doesn't re-expand (entrapped lung)."
     }
    ]
   }
